Bundled components (voicecast jars):
  - Vosk 0.3.45 (Java bindings + libvosk native libraries, based on Kaldi)
    Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/alphacephei/vosk-api
  - ONNX Runtime 1.19.2 (Java API + all-platform native libraries)
    MIT — https://onnxruntime.ai/
  - Concentus 1.0.2 (pure-Java Opus codec, jaredmdobson fork)
    MIT — https://github.com/jaredmdobson/concentus
  - JNA 5.12.1 (Vosk native binding; JiJ'd into the Fabric jar, provided by
    Architectury/Forge on Forge)
    Apache-2.0 OR LGPL-2.1-or-later — https://github.com/java-native-access/jna

Speech models (vosk-model-small-*, wav2vec2-espeak ONNX weights) are
downloaded at runtime into the config directory and are NOT part of this
distribution. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for their licenses (Apache-2.0 / CC0).
